cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Fusion depth in Digital Product Passport question answering: data and verification code"
abstract: >-
  Released per-question results for 6,270 verified product-record questions
  across four question-answering configurations, a 4,021-query arm over a public
  product schema, and scripts that recompute every number reported in the
  accompanying paper.
